invariant: INV-16
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-trust-separation.sh
reason: a device object on WIDEMUL=native carries poly1305_native.c, a file
  only a host object may hold. ct.h refuses it at compile time, and
  lint-trust-separation's WIDEMUL=native rows ban every *_native.c file
  from the object's source list.

--- old
else ifeq ($(WIDEMUL),native)
LIB_DEF += -DCH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL
--- new
else ifeq ($(WIDEMUL),native)
LIB_DEF += -DCH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL
LIB_SRCS += poly1305_native.c
